        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Frank Darabont\n- Works: The Walking Dead, \"Vatos\", The Mist, The Green Mile\n- Characters: Morales\n\nFacts:\n- Frank Darabont is the Hungarian-born American film director known for adapting Stephen King novellas into films including The Mist and The Green Mile.\n- Frank Darabont developed the television series The Walking Dead.\n- Frank Darabont created the recurring character Morales for The Walking Dead.\n- Morales appeared in the The Walking Dead episode \"Vatos\".",
